        {
            "jpName": "トウカイテイオー",
            "enName": "Tokai Teio",
            "jpText": "マヤノが『恋を知らないテイオーちゃんは\r\nまだまだコドモだよね～』って言うんだ！",
            "enText": "Mayano said I'm still a stupid kid 'cause \nI don't know anything about love!",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": 4005436654426478425,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "トウカイテイオー",
            "enName": "Tokai Teio",
            "jpText": "ボクだって恋の1つや2つできるやい！",
            "enText": "But that's not true! I know a thing \nor two about it, I swear!",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": -3682251995092941873,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "トウカイテイオー",
            "enName": "Tokai Teio",
            "jpText": "胸がドキドキしたり、苦しくなったりって\r\nすっごいレース観た時みたいなのでしょ？",
            "enText": "I mean, your chest gets all tight and your \nheart goes crazy, right? That's just like what \nhappens when I watch a super amazing race!",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "pathId": -2584145020221794924,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "トウカイテイオー",
            "enName": "Tokai Teio",
            "jpText": "……もー！　何笑ってんのさー！\r\n違うなら違うって言ってよー！",
            "enText": "Hey! What're you laughing at?! \nIf I'm wrong, just tell me!",
